# What is TRACKED in graphify-out/:
#   graph.json            - the graph itself, stored GZIPPED via the gzip_graph
#                           clean/smudge filter (see ../.gitattributes)
#   GRAPH_REPORT.md       - human-readable audit report
#   manifest.json         - incremental-update bookkeeping; --update diffs against it
#   cost.json             - cumulative token-cost tracker
#   .graphify_labels.json - community labels
#   converted/            - converted source artifacts
#
# Everything below is regenerable local state and must stay out of git.

cache/
20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
.graphify_analysis.json
memory/
backups/

# 600 KB of regenerated embedded JS -- rebuilt by any graphify run.
graph.html

# Hardcodes one machine's interpreter path.
.graphify_python

# Pipeline scratch files.
.graphify_*.json
.graphify_*.txt
.graphify_*.py
